(7302829, 1138827, 163430, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the old age marks on these birds but this one sure looks old. :-)<br/>Photographically, this image is a mix of likes and don''t likes for me.<br/>- The composition is awesome and so is the posing of the bird.<br/>- The focusing is sharp and dead on the eye. Nice work there<br/>- Shallow DoF, to me, is not enough to separate the subject from the background. It kind of blends in with it.</td>', 'I don''t know the old age marks on these birds but this one sure looks old. :-)Photographically, this image is a mix of likes and don''t likes for me.- The composition is awesome and so is the posing of the bird.- The focusing is sharp and dead on the eye. Nice work there- Shallow DoF, to me, is not enough to separate the subject from the background. It kind of blends in with it.', '2015-01-16 03:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302832, 1139090, 163430, '<td valign="top">Ha! I know that cheese. Old Amsterdam. :-)<br/>I wish there was more light on the port label. This way the lighting kind of doesn''t match the title.</td>', 'Ha! I know that cheese. Old Amsterdam. :-)I wish there was more light on the port label. This way the lighting kind of doesn''t match the title.', '2015-01-16 04:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
