(7302834, 1139156, 163430, '<td valign="top">Interesting one. I like how the color of the water pump makes it stand out. I like the composition and the processing as well. But, there are two things that i don''t:<br/>- That branch in the lower left corner. <br/>- The direction of the light, or to be precise, the shadow on the pump.</td>', 'Interesting one. I like how the color of the water pump makes it stand out. I like the composition and the processing as well. But, there are two things that i don''t:- That branch in the lower left corner. - The direction of the light, or to be precise, the shadow on the pump.', '2015-01-16 04:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
